        },
        {
          "text": "**Metacognition & Cognitive Reappraisal:** The specific \"thinking about thinking\" skills and the technique of changing emotional responses by reframing the meaning of a situation.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 113,
          "source": "topic-set_a-curated-inquiry-into-self-regulation-mastery-and-andragogy_🆔20251026133946.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Self-Determination Theory (SDT):** A core motivational theory focusing on **Autonomy, Competence, and Relatedness** as fundamental psychological needs that drive growth and behavior.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 119,
          "source": "topic-set_a-curated-inquiry-into-self-regulation-mastery-and-andragogy_🆔20251026133946.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Implementation Intentions:** The \"if-then\" planning strategy (e.g., \"If I feel X, then I will do Y\") that is a cornerstone of effective behavioral implementation.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 119,
          "source": "topic-set_a-curated-inquiry-into-self-regulation-mastery-and-andragogy_🆔20251026133946.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Bandura's Theory of Self-Efficacy:** Explores the critical role of one's *belief* in their ability to succeed as a primary determinant of in successfully managing their behavior.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 121,
          "source": "topic-set_a-curated-inquiry-into-self-regulation-mastery-and-andragogy_🆔20251026133946.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Acceptance and Commitment Therapy (ACT):** A therapeutic model that focuses on psychological flexibility, mindfulness, and value-based action, rather than directly fighting negative thoughts.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 124,
          "source": "topic-set_a-curated-inquiry-into-self-regulation-mastery-and-andragogy_🆔20251026133946.md"
        }
      ]
